      <div id="timerBar">⏰ Time Left: <span id="timerText">03:00</span></div>
      <div id="quizArea">
        <form id="quizForm">
          <div class="question"><b>Q1. Which property changes Text color?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="a"> color</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="b"> background-color</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="c"> text-color</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="d"> font-color</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q2. Which property changes Box background color?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> color</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> background-color</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> box-color</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> bg</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q3. Which is a HEX color?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="a"> #FF0000</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="b"> rgb(255,0,0)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="c"> red</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="d"> rgba(255,0,0,0.5)</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q4. Which is an RGB color?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="a"> #FF0000</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="b"> rgb(255, 0, 0)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="c"> red</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="d"> #2563eb</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q5. In RGB, what is the range of each value?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="a"> 0 to 255</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="b"> 0 to 100</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="c"> 0 to 10</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="d"> 1 to 1000</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q6. In RGBA, what does A mean?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="a"> Alpha - Transparency</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="b"> Angle</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="c"> Amount</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="d"> Area</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q7. In Opacity, what does 0 mean?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="a"> Fully transparent / Invisible</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="b"> Fully solid</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="c"> Half transparent</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="d"> Black</label></div>
